}

docs {
  # POST /api/v1/manager/clients

  Creates a client user and links them to the manager.
  If `password` is omitted, a temporary password is generated and returned.

  ## Body
  | Field | Required | Notes |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | clientName | yes | |
  | clientPhone | yes | |
  | clientEmail | yes | unique |
  | password | no | min 6 if provided |

  ## Example response `201`
  ```json
  {
    "client": {
      "id": "66f0...",
      "clientName": "Acme Ltd",
      "clientEmail": "billing@acme.test",
      "clientPhone": "+8801711222333",
      "temporaryPassword": "a8f3c2d1e9"
    }
  }
  ```
}

assert {
  res.status: in [201, 409]
}
